# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
build/
dist/

# Local scratch under data/ (the sqlite DB + HF parquet cache) is ignored.
# Root-anchored so web/data/ is not caught.
/data/*
hf_cache/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Deliverables tracked despite the data ignore. Everything a human needs to
# read/interpret a run's results lives under reports/ (entire tree — do not
# gitignore): reports/experiment_log.md (short grouped index) +
# reports/experiment_log/<run_id>.md (one detail file per run, self-
# contained from the JSONL's embedded case rows) + reports/api-comparisons/
# (the Modal-comparable per-specialist/task reports) + reports/calibration/.
#
# data/experiments/<run_id>/ raw run dirs (cases.jsonl, per_document_scores
# .jsonl, prompts_snapshot.json, subset_manifest.json{l,}, scoring_suite
# .json, summary.json, wave_lock.json) are DELIBERATELY untracked — they
# grow without bound (a big prompts_snapshot.json per run, every run,
# forever) and are not needed to read a report: reports/ is self-contained.
# They stay on disk locally for --resume / --recompute / draw-verification
# within a session; if durable access to raw per-case fidelity across
# sessions is ever needed, use a separate branch or an external artifact
# store instead of committing every run's raw dir to main.
#
# data/manifests/subset-draws/ is different: canonical, rarely-changing,
# small comparison-subset draws (#20) — stays tracked.
!/data/manifests/
!/data/manifests/subset-draws/

# The Vercel viewer snapshot IS tracked (generated by scripts/export_site_snapshot.py)
!web/data/snapshot.json

# Raw scratch/tee logs from ad-hoc run orchestration (e.g. a session's
# `tee -a <path>.log` capture of run_evals.py stdout across several jobs).
# These are unbounded and not a polished deliverable; write them outside the
# repo (e.g. /tmp/run.log) per docs/openrouter-braintrust-runbook.md. Ignored
# wherever they land under reports/ as a backstop.
reports/**/*.log

# Local pipeline checkout (uv path source; clone per README — never commit)
Digital-Mailroom/

# Env & secrets
.env
*.key

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
docs/.Rhistory
/.cursor/agents
/data/manifests
/reports/calibration
